concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41GF(1) Suspension where conformity assessment certificate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41gf-ss-1 ;
    cml:integrityHash "f31e237bc8d88a315fe3a61d1a9046c6b81da7071df38fe383a22e54ae81904e" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf ;
    skos:note "Suspension of medical device from Register upon suspension of Australian conformity assessment body certificate or overseas regulator conformity assessment document. Secretary may suspend medical device from Register if conformity assessment certificate is suspended." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.97" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1-norm .
concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1-norm a values:Obligation ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1 ;
    values:borneBy values:State ;
    skos:scopeNote "borne by: State" ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1-logic-deontic-1 .
concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1-logic-deontic-1 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibition of medical device from Register upon suspension of relevant certificates." ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register, suspend the kind of device from the Register if: (a) an Australian conformity assessment body certificate that applies to the kind of device is suspended by the Australian conformity assessment body; or (b) an overseas regulator conformity assessment document that applies to the kind of device is suspended by the overseas regulator." ;
    cml:conclusionText "(1) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register, suspend the kind of device from the Register if: (a) an Australian conformity assessment body certificate that applies to the kind of device is suspended by the Australian conformity assessment body; or (b) an overseas regulator conformity assessment document that applies to the kind of device is suspended by the overseas regulator." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

