    cml:operator "Temporal relation" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Establishes a temporal relationship between the manufacture/supply/use of medical devices and conformity assessment" ;
    cml:premiseText "(c) the conformity assessment procedures have not been applied to the device; and (d) either: (i) the use of the device has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person; or (ii) the use of the device, if the device were used, would result in, or would be likely to result in, harm or injury to any person;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "(1) A person commits an offence..." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

