    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibits using a medical device without proper authority." ;
    cml:premiseText "(c) either: (i) the use of the device has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person; or (ii) the use of the device, if the device were used, would result in, or would be likely to result in, harm or injury to any person." ;
